text":"which you can learn about in the technique section of this app.","start":1013.86,"end":1017.74,"words":[{"text":"which","start":1013.86,"end":1014.08},{"text":"you","start":1014.08,"end":1014.26},{"text":"can","start":1014.26,"end":1014.42},{"text":"learn","start":1014.42,"end":1014.64},{"text":"about","start":1014.64,"end":1015.2},{"text":"in","start":1015.2,"end":1015.58},{"text":"the","start":1015.58,"end":1015.74},{"text":"technique","start":1015.74,"end":1016.14},{"text":"section","start":1016.14,"end":1016.68},{"text":"of","start":1016.68,"end":1016.98},{"text":"this","start":1016.98,"end":1017.2},{"text":"app.","start":1017.2,"end":1017.74}]},{"text":"This can really help to remove any lingering feelings of anger, which comes from the excess of heat within.","start":1020.98,"end":1028.86,"words":[{"text":"This","start":1020.98,"end":1021.22},{"text":"can","start":1021.22,"end":1021.44},{"text":"really","start":1021.44,"end":1021.74},{"text":"help","start":1021.74,"end":1022.24},{"text":"to","start":1022.24,"end":1022.86},{"text":"remove","start":1022.86,"end":1023.32},{"text":"any","start":1023.32,"end":1023.8},{"text":"lingering","start":1023.8,"end":1024.14},{"text":"feelings","start":1024.14,"end":1024.74},{"text":"of","start":1024.74,"end":1025.02},{"text":"anger,","start":1025.02,"end":1025.86},{"text":"which","start":1026.54,"end":1026.62},{"text":"comes","start":1026.62,"end":1026.98},{"text":"from","start":1026.98,"end":1027.32},{"text":"the","start":1027.32,"end":1027.5},{"text":"excess","start":1027.5,"end":1027.82},{"text":"of","start":1027.82,"end":1028.1},{"text":"heat","start":1028.1,"end":1028.3},{"text":"within.","start":1028.3,"end":1028.86}]},{"text":"Or you can choose to remain in silent meditation.","start":1032.22,"end":1035.68,"words":[{"text":"Or","start":1032.22,"end":1032.64},{"text":"you","start":1032.64,"end":1033.1},{"text":"can","start":1033.1,"end":1033.3},{"text":"choose","start":1033.3,"end":1033.7},{"text":"to","start":